  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Protection Assistance targeting Food Insecure Populations in Bay and Benadir.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of this $3m UNHCR project is to provide integrated protection response and enhance food security of the most vulnerable. To that end, UNHCR will provide cash for protective shelter and NFI, provide multi-purpose cash and conduct protection monitoring and strengthen referral. In total, 165,000 people will be targeted, including 34,320 women and 51,480 girls, and among these 44,500 will be reached through cash assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
